<p id="S4.SS2.p15.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p15.2.1" class="ltx_text">Furthermore, let <math id="S4.SS2.p15.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X_{\ell+1}=N^{-}(v_{\ell})\setminus\Big(V(P)\cup\bigcup_{j=0}^{\ell}X_{j}\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">∪</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X_{\ell+1}=N^{-}(v_{\ell})\setminus\Big(V(P)\cup\bigcup_{j=0}^{\ell}X_{j}\Big)</annotation></semantics></math>.
The point is that now some structure is forced,
see Figure <a href="#S4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Proof of Theorem . ‣ 4.2 A polynomial-time algorithm for Acyclic 2-Dicolouring on tournaments ‣ 4 Complexity ‣ Acyclic dichromatic number of oriented graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> for an illustration.</span></p>
